IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0028.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY CRD0028C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==IN==.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 DECISION-CD        PIC X VALUE 'D'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM DECIDE-APPLICATION
    DISPLAY "DECISION-CD=" DECISION-CD
    STOP RUN.
DECIDE-APPLICATION.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 2001
    *>  IF IN-CR-SCORE >= 592
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    *> AUTOMATIC APPROVAL
    IF IN-CR-SCORE >= 740 AND IN-DEBT-RATIO < 0.43
        MOVE 'A' TO DECISION-CD
    ELSE
        *> REFER TO UNDERWRITER
        IF IN-CR-SCORE >= 660
            MOVE 'R' TO DECISION-CD
        ELSE
            MOVE 'D' TO DECISION-CD
        END-IF
    END-IF.
